---
description: Update Memory.md at session start and after every command
alwaysApply: true
---

# Memory.md always

- Read [Memory.md](Memory.md) before other work in every session.
- Before the first command, append missing prior work to the progress log.
- After every completed command or task, append a dated bullet: what ran, what changed, what broke, what is next.
- Do not start the next task until Memory.md is current.
- Never store secrets, tokens, or private user/document text.
